{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"历代志上","commonName":"历代志上","title":"历代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"fc4564236e3ad71076ed44b678c67d6581a3c5d084477a871eeffdf3670ae182","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":938},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["运回约柜"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["大卫跟千夫长、百夫长等所有的首领商议，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["然后对以色列全体会众说：“如果你们赞成，而且如果这是我们上帝耶和华的旨意，我们就派人到以色列各地把其他同胞，包括住在城邑及草场的祭司和利未人召集来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我们要将我们上帝的约柜运到这里来，因为在扫罗执政期间，我们没有求问它。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["会众都表示赞同，认为这样做很好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["于是，大卫召集了从埃及的西曷河一直到哈马口的全体以色列人，要将上帝的约柜从基列·耶琳运来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["大卫率领以色列众人到巴拉，即犹大的基列·耶琳，要将上帝的约柜运回来。这约柜以坐在基路伯天使上面的耶和华的名字命名。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他们把上帝的约柜从亚比拿达家抬出来，放在一辆新车上，由乌撒和亚希约赶车。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["大卫和以色列众人就在上帝面前用琴、瑟、鼓、钹和号奏乐，尽情歌舞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他们到基顿的麦场时，拉车的牛失蹄，乌撒就伸手去扶约柜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["因他伸手碰了约柜，耶和华便向他发怒，击杀了他，他当场死在上帝面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["大卫因耶和华击杀乌撒而烦恼，就称那地方为毗列斯·乌撒",{"noteId":7},"，沿用至今。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["那天，大卫惧怕上帝，他说：“我怎能将上帝的约柜运到我这里？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因此，大卫没有将约柜运进大卫城，而是把它运到迦特人俄别·以东家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["上帝的约柜在俄别·以东家存放了三个月。耶和华使俄别·以东家及其拥有的一切都蒙福。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"“毗列斯·乌撒”意思是“向乌撒发怒”。","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}